            "review_title": "Review at Van Mieu Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mel C\nUnited Kingdom33 contributions\n0\nVery tasty food with a fabulous philosophy to help young, disadvantaged people 😁\nFeb 2025 • Friends\nA great experience 😁. The food was delicious and the philosophy of the restaurant was inspiring. The whole team were very friendly and we were served by young people who without this restaurant would have very few prospects. They are given excellent training in the hospitality business to help them get jobs that offer them a good chance in life. I had crab the best crab spring rolls I have ever had and the rest of our group were delighted by their food too\nRead more\nWritten February 13, 2025",
